review:
Positives:
- Not expensive;
- Decent graphics;
- Several game modes;
- Many different ships.

Negatives:
- The music is bearable in some stages, but out of place in others and almost grating;
- Dull gameplay, the levels are too easy and generally quite boring, you just go left and right all the time to collect the points;
- Boss difficulty all over the place, with very similar patterns which just start spamming at some point;
- It's not clear where your hitbox is, so the above point becomes really frustrating;
- I gave it a few tries over the year, but the fun factor is not really there.

As others have said, there are many great games of this genre to choose instead, of the less known ones I would recomment danmaku unlimited 2 (3 also is quite good).
2026 edit: get yourself "shoot 1up" instead! Half the price, double the fun, 30X the ships.
